{"title": "Psionic Dominance (passive feature)", "pageid": 40240, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Psionic_Dominance_(passive_feature)", "categories": ["Reactions", "Passive features", "Pages using deprecated parameters", "Illithid Powers"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Psionic_Dominance.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Psionic_Dominance.webp/300px-Psionic_Dominance.webp, /w/images/e/ee/Psionic_Dominance.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/e/ee/Psionic_Dominance.webp/300px-Psionic_Dominance.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/e/ee/Psionic_Dominance.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Psionic Dominance</b> is a passive feature and <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_Power\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Illithid Power\">Illithid Power</a>. This feature allows a character to use a reaction to nullify a spell of lower or equal level to their <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency Bonus\">Proficiency Bonus</a> when targeted by an enemy within 18m.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>When an enemy within 18 m (60 ft) targets you with a spell of a Level that is lower than or equal to your <a href=\"/wiki/Proficiency_Bonus\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Proficiency Bonus\">Proficiency Bonus</a>, you can use your reaction to nullify the spell. \n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Details\"> Details </span></h3>\n<dl class=\"bg3wiki-property-list\">\n<dt> Cost: </dt><dd> <span class=\"bg3wiki-info-blob\"><span style=\"margin: -3px\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon nowrap\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/35px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/46px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png/23px-Reaction_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/c/c1/Reaction_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Actions#Reactions\" title=\"Actions\">Reaction</a></span> </dd>\n</dl>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grants:\"> Grants: </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<ul style=\"list-style: none;\">\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Dominance\" title=\"Psionic Dominance\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp/40px-Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp/60px-Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/8/85/Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp/80px-Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Psionic Dominance\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/8/85/Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp/40px-Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/8/85/Psionic_Dominance_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Psionic_Dominance\" title=\"Psionic Dominance\">Psionic Dominance</a></li>\n</ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li><a href=\"/wiki/Full-illithid\" title=\"Full-illithid\">Full-illithid</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Metamage_Persecutor\" title=\"Metamage Persecutor\">Metamage Persecutor</a></li></ul>\n<p>Other ways to learn:\n</p>\n<ul><li>After becoming a <a href=\"/wiki/Partial-Illithid\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Partial-Illithid\">Partial-Illithid</a>, unlock from the <a href=\"/wiki/Illithid_powers\" title=\"Illithid powers\">illithid power</a> skill tree with a <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_Flayer_Parasite_Specimen\" title=\"Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen\">Mind Flayer Parasite Specimen</a> after obtaining one of the following:\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Charm\" title=\"Charm\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp/25px-Charm_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp/38px-Charm_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp/50px-Charm_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Charm\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp/25px-Charm_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/5d/Charm_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Charm\" title=\"Charm\">Charm</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Black_Hole\" title=\"Black Hole\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Black_Hole_Icon.webp/25px-Black_Hole_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Black_Hole_Icon.webp/38px-Black_Hole_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/75/Black_Hole_Icon.webp/50px-Black_Hole_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Black Hole\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/75/Black_Hole_Icon.webp/25px-Black_Hole_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/75/Black_Hole_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Black_Hole\" title=\"Black Hole\">Black Hole</a></li></ul></li></ul>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip\">\n<ul><li>Normally, this reaction can counter a spell of up to level 4 since that is the usual maximum proficiency bonus. However, on <a href=\"/wiki/Explorer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Explorer\">Explorer</a> difficulty, the proficiency bonus of <em>all</em> characters is increased by 2. This means Psionic Dominance can counter up to level 6 spells on Explorer difficulty, including when enemies use it against the party. Custom difficulty offers a slider to adjust the proficiency bonus which has the same effect.</li></ul>\n</div>     \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260715015124\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.040 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.044 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 1231/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 11350/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 4821/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 21/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 232/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.011/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1051898/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   36.848      1 Template:Passive_feature_page\n100.00%   36.848      1 -total\n 28.05%   10.336      1 Template:InfoBlob\n 26.72%    9.845      1 Template:ResourceList\n 19.79%    7.292      3 Template:SAI\n 17.42%    6.418      3 Template:Icon_link\n 16.18%    5.962      3 Template:Icon_text\n 11.90%    4.386      1 Template:PageSeo\n 11.20%    4.127      6 Template:Trim\n 11.10%    4.091      1 Template:Hidden_code\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parse